/*â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•
  PlaceMeâ€”DesignSystem
  Premiumdarkthemewithglassmorphism,gradients,andmicro-animations
  â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•*/

:root{
 /*â”€â”€Colorsâ”€â”€*/
 --bg-primary:#0a0e1a;
 --bg-secondary:#111827;
 --bg-card:rgba(17,24,39,0.7);
 --bg-card-hover:rgba(29,38,59,0.8);
 --bg-glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
 --bg-input:rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
 --bg-sidebar:rgba(10,14,26,0.95);

 --border-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
 --border-active:rgba(139,92,246,0.5);

 --text-primary:#f1f5f9;
 --text-secondary:#94a3b8;
 --text-muted:#64748b;
 --text-heading:#e2e8f0;

 --accent-purple:#8b5cf6;
 --accent-purple-light:#a78bfa;
 --accent-blue:#3b82f6;
 --accent-cyan:#06b6d4;
 --accent-green:#10b981;
 --accent-amber:#f59e0b;
 --accent-red:#ef4444;
 --accent-pink:#ec4899;

 --gradient-primary:linear-gradient(135deg,#8b5cf60%,#3b82f6100%);
 --gradient-accent:linear-gradient(135deg,#06b6d40%,#8b5cf6100%);
 --gradient-warm:linear-gradient(135deg,#f59e0b0%,#ef4444100%);
 --gradient-success:linear-gradient(135deg,#10b9810%,#06b6d4100%);
 --gradient-bg:radial-gradient(ellipseat20%50%,rgba(139,92,246,0.08)0%,transparent50%),
         radial-gradient(ellipseat80%20%,rgba(59,130,246,0.06)0%,transparent50%),
         radial-gradient(ellipseat50%80%,rgba(6,182,212,0.04)0%,transparent50%);

 /*â”€â”€Typographyâ”€â”€*/
 --font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,sans-serif;
 --fs-xs:0.75rem;
 --fs-sm:0.8125rem;
 --fs-base:0.9375rem;
 --fs-lg:1.125rem;
 --fs-xl:1.375rem;
 --fs-2xl:1.75rem;
 --fs-3xl:2.25rem;

 /*â”€â”€Spacingâ”€â”€*/
 --sp-1:0.25rem;
 --sp-2:0.5rem;
 --sp-3:0.75rem;
 --sp-4:1rem;
 --sp-5:1.25rem;
 --sp-6:1.5rem;
 --sp-8:2rem;
 --sp-10:2.5rem;
 --sp-12:3rem;

 /*â”€â”€Miscâ”€â”€*/
 --radius-sm:6px;
 --radius-md:10px;
 --radius-lg:16px;
 --radius-xl:24px;
 --shadow-sm:01px2pxrgba(0,0,0,0.3);
 --shadow-md:04px12pxrgba(0,0,0,0.3);
 --shadow-lg:08px30pxrgba(0,0,0,0.4);
 --shadow-glow:0020pxrgba(139,92,246,0.15);
 --transition:all0.2scubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1);
 --transition-slow:all0.4scubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1);

 --sidebar-width:260px;
}

/*â”€â”€Resetâ”€â”€*/
*,*::before,*::after{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}

html{
 font-size:16px;
 -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
 -moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale;
}

body{
 font-family:var(--font-family);
 background:var(--bg-primary);
 color:var(--text-primary);
 line-height:1.6;
 min-height:100vh;
}

body::before{
 content:'';
 position:fixed;
 inset:0;
 background:var(--gradient-bg);
 pointer-events:none;
 z-index:0;
}

#root{
 position:relative;
 z-index:1;
 min-height:100vh;
}

a{color:var(--accent-purple-light);text-decoration:none;transition:var(--transition);}
a:hover{color:var(--accent-purple);}

/*â”€â”€Layoutâ”€â”€*/
.app-layout{
 display:flex;
 min-height:100vh;
}

.sidebar{
 width:var(--sidebar-width);
 background:var(--bg-sidebar);
 border-right:1pxsolidvar(--border-color);
 padding:var(--sp-6)0;
 display:flex;
 flex-direction:column;
 position:fixed;
 top:0;
 left:0;
 bottom:0;
 z-index:100;
 backdrop-filter:blur(20px);
 transition:var(--transition-slow);
}

.sidebar-logo{
 padding:0var(--sp-6)var(--sp-6);
 border-bottom:1pxsolidvar(--border-color);
 margin-bottom:var(--sp-4);
}

.sidebar-logoh1{
 font-size:var(--fs-xl);
 font-weight:800;
 background:var(--gradient-primary);
 -webkit-background-clip:text;
 -webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;
 background-clip:text;
 letter-spacing:-0.5px;
}

.sidebar-logop{
 font-size:var(--fs-xs);
 color:var(--text-muted);
 margin-top:var(--sp-1);
 text-transform:uppercase;
 letter-spacing:1.5px;
}

.sidebar-nav{
 flex:1;
 padding:0var(--sp-3);
 display:flex;
 flex-direction:column;
 gap:var(--sp-1);
}

.nav-link{
 display:flex;
 align-items:center;
 gap:var(--sp-3);
 padding:var(--sp-3)var(--sp-4);
 border-radius:var(--radius-md);
 color:var(--text-secondary);
 font-size:var(--fs-sm);
 font-weight:500;
 transition:var(--transition);
 cursor:pointer;
 border:none;
 background:none;
 width:100%;
 text-align:left;
}

.nav-link:hover{
 background:rgba(139,92,246,0.08);
 color:var(--text-primary);
}

.nav-link.active{
 background:rgba(139,92,246,0.12);
 color:var(--accent-purple-light);
 box-shadow:inset3px00var(--accent-purple);
}

.nav-linksvg{
 width:20px;
 height:20px;
 flex-shrink:0;
}

.sidebar-footer{
 padding:var(--sp-4)var(--sp-4);
 border-top:1pxsolidvar(--border-color);
 margin-top:auto;
}

.sidebar-user{
 display:flex;
 align-items:center;
 gap:var(--sp-3);
 padding:var(--sp-3);
 border-radius:var(--radius-md);
 background:var(--bg-glass);
}

.sidebar-user-avatar{
 width:36px;
 height:36px;
 border-radius:50%;
 background:var(--gradient-primary);
 display:flex;
 align-items:center;
 justify-content:center;
 font-weight:700;
 font-size:var(--fs-sm);
 color:white;
 flex-shrink:0;
}

.sidebar-user-info{
 flex:1;
 min-width:0;
}

.sidebar-user-name{
 font-size:var(--fs-sm);
 font-weight:600;
 white-space:nowrap;
 overflow:hidden;
 text-overflow:ellipsis;
}

.sidebar-user-email{
 font-size:var(--fs-xs);
 color:var(--text-muted);
 white-space:nowrap;
 overflow:hidden;
 text-overflow:ellipsis;
}

.main-content{
 flex:1;
 margin-left:var(--sidebar-width);
 padding:var(--sp-8);
 min-height:100vh;
}

/*â”€â”€Cardsâ”€â”€*/
.card{
 background:var(--bg-card);
 border:1pxsolidvar(--border-color);
 border-radius:var(--radius-lg);
 padding:var(--sp-6);
 backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
 transition:var(--transition);
}

.card:hover{
 border-color:rgba(139,92,246,0.2);
 box-shadow:var(--shadow-glow);
}

.card-header{
 display:flex;
 align-items:center;
 justify-content:space-between;
 margin-bottom:var(--sp-5);
}

.card-title{
 font-size:var(--fs-lg);
 font-weight:700;
 color:var(--text-heading);
}

/*â”€â”€KPICardsâ”€â”€*/
.kpi-grid{
 display:grid;
 grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));
 gap:var(--sp-5);
 margin-bottom:var(--sp-8);
}

.kpi-card{
 background:var(--bg-card);
 border:1pxsolidvar(--border-color);
 border-radius:var(--radius-lg);
 padding:var(--sp-5)var(--sp-6);
 backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
 transition:var(--transition);
 position:relative;
 overflow:hidden;
}

.kpi-card::before{
 content:'';
 position:absolute;
 top:0;
 left:0;
 right:0;
 height:3px;
 background:var(--gradient-primary);
 opacity:0;
 transition:var(--transition);
}

.kpi-card:hover::before{
 opacity:1;
}

.kpi-card:hover{
 transform:translateY(-2px);
 box-shadow:var(--shadow-lg);
 border-color:rgba(139,92,246,0.2);
}

.kpi-icon{
 width:44px;
 height:44px;
 border-radius:var(--radius-md);
 display:flex;
 align-items:center;
 justify-content:center;
 margin-bottom:var(--sp-3);
}

.kpi-icon.purple{background:rgba(139,92,246,0.15);color:var(--accent-purple);}
.kpi-icon.blue{background:rgba(59,130,246,0.15);color:var(--accent-blue);}
.kpi-icon.green{background:rgba(16,185,129,0.15);color:var(--accent-green);}
.kpi-icon.amber{background:rgba(245,158,11,0.15);color:var(--accent-amber);}
.kpi-icon.red{background:rgba(239,68,68,0.15);color:var(--accent-red);}
.kpi-icon.cyan{background:rgba(6,182,212,0.15);color:var(--accent-cyan);}

.kpi-value{
 font-size:var(--fs-2xl);
 font-weight:800;
 color:var(--text-heading);
 line-height:1.2;
}

.kpi-label{
 font-size:var(--fs-sm);
 color:var(--text-secondary);
 margin-top:var(--sp-1);
}

/*â”€â”€Buttonsâ”€â”€*/
.btn{
 display:inline-flex;
 align-items:center;
 justify-content:center;
 gap:var(--sp-2);
 padding:var(--sp-2)var(--sp-5);
 border-radius:var(--radius-md);
 font-size:var(--fs-sm);
 font-weight:600;
 font-family:var(--font-family);
 cursor:pointer;
 border:1pxsolidtransparent;
 transition:var(--transition);
 white-space:nowrap;
 line-height:1.6;
}

.btnsvg{width:16px;height:16px;}

.btn-primary{
 background:var(--gradient-primary);
 color:white;
 border:none;
 box-shadow:02px10pxrgba(139,92,246,0.3);
}

.btn-primary:hover{
 transform:translateY(-1px);
 box-shadow:04px20pxrgba(139,92,246,0.4);
}

.btn-secondary{
 background:var(--bg-input);
 color:var(--text-primary);
 border-color:var(--border-color);
}

.btn-secondary:hover{
 background:rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
 border-color:var(--accent-purple);
}

.btn-danger{
 background:rgba(239,68,68,0.15);
 color:var(--accent-red);
 border-color:rgba(239,68,68,0.3);
}

.btn-danger:hover{
 background:rgba(239,68,68,0.25);
}

.btn-ghost{
 background:transparent;
 color:var(--text-secondary);
 border:none;
 padding:var(--sp-2);
}

.btn-ghost:hover{
 color:var(--text-primary);
 background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
}

.btn-sm{
 padding:var(--sp-1)var(--sp-3);
 font-size:var(--fs-xs);
}

.btn-lg{
 padding:var(--sp-3)var(--sp-8);
 font-size:var(--fs-base);
}

/*â”€â”€Formsâ”€â”€*/
.form-group{
 margin-bottom:var(--sp-5);
}

.form-label{
 display:block;
 font-size:var(--fs-sm);
 font-weight:600;
 color:var(--text-secondary);
 margin-bottom:var(--sp-2);
}

.form-input,
.form-select,
.form-textarea{
 width:100%;
 padding:var(--sp-3)var(--sp-4);
 background:var(--bg-input);
 border:1pxsolidvar(--border-color);
 border-radius:var(--radius-md);
 color:var(--text-primary);
 font-size:var(--fs-sm);
 font-family:var(--font-family);
 transition:var(--transition);
 outline:none;
}

.form-input:focus,
.form-select:focus,
.form-textarea:focus{
 border-color:var(--accent-purple);
 box-shadow:0003pxrgba(139,92,246,0.15);
 background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
}

.form-input::placeholder,
.form-textarea::placeholder{
 color:var(--text-muted);
}

.form-textarea{
 resize:vertical;
 min-height:100px;
}

.form-select{
 appearance:none;
 cursor:pointer;
 background-image:url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvgxmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'width='12'height='12'viewBox='001212'%3E%3Cpathfill='%2394a3b8'd='M68L13h10z'/%3E%3C/svg%3E");
 background-repeat:no-repeat;
 background-position:right12pxcenter;
 padding-right:36px;
}

.form-selectoption{
 background:var(--bg-secondary);
 color:var(--text-primary);
}

.form-row{
 display:grid;
 grid-template-columns:1fr1fr;
 gap:var(--sp-4);
}

.form-error{
 color:var(--accent-red);
 font-size:var(--fs-xs);
 margin-top:var(--sp-1);
}

/*â”€â”€StatusBadgesâ”€â”€*/
.badge{
 display:inline-flex;
 align-items:center;
 gap:var(--sp-1);
 padding:2px10px;
 border-radius:100px;
 font-size:var(--fs-xs);
 font-weight:600;
 letter-spacing:0.3px;
}

.badge-applied{background:rgba(59,130,246,0.15);color:var(--accent-blue);}
.badge-shortlisted{background:rgba(6,182,212,0.15);color:var(--accent-cyan);}
.badge-interview{background:rgba(245,158,11,0.15);color:var(--accent-amber);}
.badge-selected{background:rgba(16,185,129,0.15);color:var(--accent-green);}
.badge-rejected{background:rgba(239,68,68,0.15);color:var(--accent-red);}
.badge-pending{background:rgba(148,163,184,0.15);color:var(--text-secondary);}
.badge-passed{background:rgba(16,185,129,0.15);color:var(--accent-green);}
.badge-failed{background:rgba(239,68,68,0.15);color:var(--accent-red);}

.badge-easy{background:rgba(16,185,129,0.15);color:var(--accent-green);}
.badge-medium{background:rgba(245,158,11,0.15);color:var(--accent-amber);}
.badge-hard{background:rgba(239,68,68,0.15);color:var(--accent-red);}

/*â”€â”€Modalâ”€â”€*/
.modal-overlay{
 position:fixed;
 inset:0;
 background:rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
 backdrop-filter:blur(4px);
 display:flex;
 align-items:center;
 justify-content:center;
 z-index:1000;
 padding:var(--sp-4);
 animation:fadeIn0.2sease;
}

.modal{
 background:var(--bg-secondary);
 border:1pxsolidvar(--border-color);
 border-radius:var(--radius-xl);
 width:100%;
 max-width:560px;
 max-height:90vh;
 overflow-y:auto;
 box-shadow:var(--shadow-lg);
 animation:slideUp0.3scubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1);
}

.modal-header{
 display:flex;
 align-items:center;
 justify-content:space-between;
 padding:var(--sp-5)var(--sp-6);
 border-bottom:1pxsolidvar(--border-color);
}

.modal-title{
 font-size:var(--fs-lg);
 font-weight:700;
}

.modal-body{
 padding:var(--sp-6);
}

.modal-footer{
 padding:var(--sp-4)var(--sp-6);
 border-top:1pxsolidvar(--border-color);
 display:flex;
 justify-content:flex-end;
 gap:var(--sp-3);
}

/*â”€â”€Tableâ”€â”€*/
.table-wrap{
 overflow-x:auto;
 border-radius:var(--radius-lg);
 border:1pxsolidvar(--border-color);
}

.table{
 width:100%;
 border-collapse:collapse;
}

.tableth{
 text-align:left;
 padding:var(--sp-3)var(--sp-4);
 font-size:var(--fs-xs);
 font-weight:700;
 color:var(--text-muted);
 text-transform:uppercase;
 letter-spacing:0.5px;
 background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);
 border-bottom:1pxsolidvar(--border-color);
}

.tabletd{
 padding:var(--sp-3)var(--sp-4);
 font-size:var(--fs-sm);
 border-bottom:1pxsolidvar(--border-color);
 vertical-align:middle;
}

.tabletr:last-childtd{
 border-bottom:none;
}

.tabletr:hovertd{
 background:rgba(139,92,246,0.03);
}

.table-company{
 font-weight:600;
 color:var(--text-heading);
}

.table-role{
 color:var(--text-secondary);
 font-size:var(--fs-xs);
}

.table-actions{
 display:flex;
 gap:var(--sp-1);
}

/*â”€â”€PageHeaderâ”€â”€*/
.page-header{
 display:flex;
 align-items:center;
 justify-content:space-between;
 margin-bottom:var(--sp-8);
}

.page-title{
 font-size:var(--fs-2xl);
 font-weight:800;
 color:var(--text-heading);
 letter-spacing:-0.5px;
}

.page-subtitle{
 font-size:var(--fs-sm);
 color:var(--text-muted);
 margin-top:var(--sp-1);
}

/*â”€â”€StatusPipelineâ”€â”€*/
.pipeline{
 display:flex;
 align-items:center;
 gap:0;
 margin:var(--sp-6)0;
}

.pipeline-step{
 flex:1;
 text-align:center;
 position:relative;
 padding:var(--sp-3)var(--sp-2);
}

.pipeline-step::after{
 content:'';
 position:absolute;
 top:22px;
 right:-50%;
 width:100%;
 height:2px;
 background:var(--border-color);
 z-index:0;
}

.pipeline-step:last-child::after{display:none;}

.pipeline-dot{
 width:28px;
 height:28px;
 border-radius:50%;
 border:2pxsolidvar(--border-color);
 background:var(--bg-secondary);
 display:flex;
 align-items:center;
 justify-content:center;
 margin:0autovar(--sp-2);
 position:relative;
 z-index:1;
 transition:var(--transition);
}

.pipeline-dotsvg{
 width:14px;
 height:14px;
}

.pipeline-step.active.pipeline-dot{
 background:var(--accent-purple);
 border-color:var(--accent-purple);
 box-shadow:0012pxrgba(139,92,246,0.4);
}

.pipeline-step.completed.pipeline-dot{
 background:var(--accent-green);
 border-color:var(--accent-green);
 color:white;
}

.pipeline-step.completed::after{
 background:var(--accent-green);
}

.pipeline-step.rejected.pipeline-dot{
 background:var(--accent-red);
 border-color:var(--accent-red);
 color:white;
}

.pipeline-label{
 font-size:var(--fs-xs);
 color:var(--text-muted);
 font-weight:500;
}

.pipeline-step.active.pipeline-label,
.pipeline-step.completed.pipeline-label{
 color:var(--text-primary);
}

/*â”€â”€Timelineâ”€â”€*/
.timeline{
 position:relative;
 padding-left:var(--sp-8);
}

.timeline::before{
 content:'';
 position:absolute;
 left:11px;
 top:0;
 bottom:0;
 width:2px;
 background:var(--border-color);
}

.timeline-item{
 position:relative;
 padding-bottom:var(--sp-6);
}

.timeline-item:last-child{padding-bottom:0;}

.timeline-dot{
 position:absolute;
 left:calc(-1*var(--sp-8)+4px);
 top:4px;
 width:16px;
 height:16px;
 border-radius:50%;
 background:var(--accent-purple);
 border:3pxsolidvar(--bg-secondary);
}

.timeline-content{
 background:var(--bg-glass);
 border:1pxsolidvar(--border-color);
 border-radius:var(--radius-md);
 padding:var(--sp-4);
 transition:var(--transition);
}

.timeline-content:hover{
 border-color:rgba(139,92,246,0.2);
}

/*â”€â”€AuthPagesâ”€â”€*/
.auth-page{
 min-height:100vh;
 display:flex;
 align-items:center;
 justify-content:center;
 padding:var(--sp-4);
}

.auth-card{
 width:100%;
 max-width:440px;
 background:var(--bg-card);
 border:1pxsolidvar(--border-color);
 border-radius:var(--radius-xl);
 padding:var(--sp-10);
 backdrop-filter:blur(20px);
 box-shadow:var(--shadow-lg);
}

.auth-logo{
 text-align:center;
 margin-bottom:var(--sp-8);
}

.auth-logoh1{
 font-size:var(--fs-2xl);
 font-weight:800;
 background:var(--gradient-primary);
 -webkit-background-clip:text;
 -webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;
 background-clip:text;
}

.auth-logop{
 color:var(--text-muted);
 font-size:var(--fs-sm);
 margin-top:var(--sp-2);
}

.auth-footer{
 text-align:center;
 margin-top:var(--sp-6);
 font-size:var(--fs-sm);
 color:var(--text-muted);
}

.auth-footera{
 color:var(--accent-purple-light);
 font-weight:600;
}

/*â”€â”€ChartsGridâ”€â”€*/
.charts-grid{
 display:grid;
 grid-template-columns:1fr1fr;
 gap:var(--sp-5);
 margin-bottom:var(--sp-5);
}

.chart-card{
 background:var(--bg-card);
 border:1pxsolidvar(--border-color);
 border-radius:var(--radius-lg);
 padding:var(--sp-6);
 backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
}

.chart-card.full-width{
 grid-column:1/-1;
}

.chart-title{
 font-size:var(--fs-base);
 font-weight:700;
 color:var(--text-heading);
 margin-bottom:var(--sp-4);
}

/*â”€â”€ResumeAnalysisâ”€â”€*/
.analysis-grid{
 display:grid;
 grid-template-columns:1fr1fr;
 gap:var(--sp-5);
}

.analysis-score{
 text-align:center;
 padding:var(--sp-8);
}

.score-circle{
 width:160px;
 height:160px;
 border-radius:50%;
 margin:0autovar(--sp-4);
 display:flex;
 align-items:center;
 justify-content:center;
 font-size:var(--fs-3xl);
 font-weight:800;
 position:relative;
}

.score-circle::before{
 content:'';
 position:absolute;
 inset:0;
 border-radius:50%;
 padding:4px;
 background:var(--gradient-primary);
 -webkit-mask:linear-gradient(#fff00)content-box,linear-gradient(#fff00);
 mask:linear-gradient(#fff00)content-box,linear-gradient(#fff00);
 -webkit-mask-composite:xor;
 mask-composite:exclude;
}

.skill-tags{
 display:flex;
 flex-wrap:wrap;
 gap:var(--sp-2);
}

.skill-tag{
 padding:var(--sp-1)var(--sp-3);
 border-radius:100px;
 font-size:var(--fs-xs);
 font-weight:600;
}

.skill-tag.matched{
 background:rgba(16,185,129,0.15);
 color:var(--accent-green);
}

.skill-tag.missing{
 background:rgba(239,68,68,0.15);
 color:var(--accent-red);
}

/*â”€â”€Insightsâ”€â”€*/
.insight-card{
 background:var(--bg-card);
 border:1pxsolidvar(--border-color);
 border-radius:var(--radius-lg);
 padding:var(--sp-6);
 margin-bottom:var(--sp-5);
}

.insight-header{
 display:flex;
 align-items:center;
 gap:var(--sp-3);
 margin-bottom:var(--sp-4);
}

.insight-icon{
 width:40px;
 height:40px;
 border-radius:var(--radius-md);
 display:flex;
 align-items:center;
 justify-content:center;
}

.suggestion-list{
 list-style:none;
}

.suggestion-listli{
 padding:var(--sp-3)var(--sp-4);
 border-left:3pxsolidvar(--accent-purple);
 background:var(--bg-glass);
 border-radius:0var(--radius-sm)var(--radius-sm)0;
 margin-bottom:var(--sp-2);
 font-size:var(--fs-sm);
 color:var(--text-secondary);
}

/*â”€â”€EmptyStateâ”€â”€*/
.empty-state{
 text-align:center;
 padding:var(--sp-12)var(--sp-4);
 color:var(--text-muted);
}

.empty-statesvg{
 width:64px;
 height:64px;
 margin-bottom:var(--sp-4);
 opacity:0.3;
}

.empty-stateh3{
 font-size:var(--fs-lg);
 color:var(--text-secondary);
 margin-bottom:var(--sp-2);
}

.empty-statep{
 font-size:var(--fs-sm);
 margin-bottom:var(--sp-5);
}

/*â”€â”€Search&FilterBarâ”€â”€*/
.filter-bar{
 display:flex;
 gap:var(--sp-3);
 margin-bottom:var(--sp-5);
 flex-wrap:wrap;
}
.filter-bar.form-input,

.filter-bar.form-select{

 max-width:250px;

}



/*%%Animations%%*/

@keyframesfadeIn{

 from{opacity:0;}

 to{opacity:1;}

}



@keyframesslideUp{

 from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px);}

 to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);}

}



@keyframespulse{

 0%,100%{opacity:1;}

 50%{opacity:0.5;}

}



.fade-in{

 animation:fadeIn0.3sease;

}



.slide-up{

 animation:slideUp0.4scubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1);

}



/*%%Logoutbutton%%*/

.btn-logout{

 width:100%;

 margin-top:var(--sp-3);

 justify-content:center;

}



/*%%BackLink%%*/

.back-link{

 display:inline-flex;

 align-items:center;

 gap:var(--sp-2);

 color:var(--text-secondary);

 font-size:var(--fs-sm);

 margin-bottom:var(--sp-5);

 transition:var(--transition);

}



.back-link:hover{color:var(--accent-purple-light);}



/*%%DetailSections%%*/

.detail-section{

 margin-bottom:var(--sp-8);

}



.detail-section-title{

 font-size:var(--fs-lg);

 font-weight:700;

 color:var(--text-heading);

 margin-bottom:var(--sp-4);

 display:flex;

 align-items:center;

 gap:var(--sp-2);

}



.detail-grid{

 display:grid;

 grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(200px,1fr));

 gap:var(--sp-4);

}



.detail-itemlabel{

 display:block;

 font-size:var(--fs-xs);

 color:var(--text-muted);

 text-transform:uppercase;

 letter-spacing:0.5px;

 margin-bottom:var(--sp-1);

}



.detail-itemp{

 font-size:var(--fs-base);

 font-weight:600;

 color:var(--text-primary);

}



